            <span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-japandi-moss">Surgical Excellence</span>
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-serif text-japandi-charcoal font-medium">Relieve Impaction &amp; Pain</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-japandi-earth leading-relaxed font-light">
              Impacted wisdom teeth often push against healthy adjacent second molars, causing root decay, gum pocketing, and severe cheek bite ulcers. Early extraction protects your dental arch permanently.
            </p>
