            <div class="p-3.5 rounded-2xl bg-japandi-cream/90 border border-japandi-clay/40">
              <span class="block text-xl font-serif text-japandi-moss font-semibold">20-35 min</span>
              <span class="text-[11px] text-japandi-earth">Average Procedure Time</span>
            </div>
            <div class="p-3.5 rounded-2xl bg-japandi-cream/90 border border-japandi-clay/40">
              <span class="block text-xl font-serif text-japandi-moss font-semibold">24-48 hrs</span>
              <span class="text-[11px] text-japandi-earth">Rapid Normal Routine Recovery</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-japandi-sand/60 border border-japandi-clay/40 text-xs text-japandi-charcoal space-y-1">
            <p class="font-medium">Hennur Surgical Clinic:</p>
            <p class="text-japandi-earth font-light">2nd Floor, SLV Nilaya, Horamavu Agara Road, Near Nayara Petrol Bunk, Bangalore 562149. Dedicated on-site patient parking.</p>
